WEBVTT

00:13:27.219 --> 00:13:33.642
(Applause)

00:13:36.186 --> 00:13:39.940
He said, "Paula, I don't understand this,

00:13:39.982 --> 00:13:41.650
but I am willing to try."

00:13:43.318 --> 00:13:48.407
My father is 93 years old,

00:13:48.407 --> 00:13:50.367
and he's willing to try.

00:13:51.535 --> 00:13:53.203
What more could I ask?

00:13:53.871 --> 00:13:56.164
I hugged him so tightly.

00:13:57.374 --> 00:14:01.378
One man, willing to give up his power